      "context": {
        "problem_id": "64480258-1fec-4a84-90d1-db7c3c9aa713",
        "normalized_content": {
          "assets": [
            {
              "alt": "",
              "url": "/assets/3f8957dd-6a7f-467f-9ea1-0eeb12e56607",
              "kind": "ordinary_image",
              "asset_id": "3f8957dd-6a7f-467f-9ea1-0eeb12e56607",
              "asset_key": "image_1",
              "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"
            },
            {
              "alt": "",
              "url": "/assets/e231e60a-910f-405d-93f0-5c6dd10a14c7",
              "kind": "ordinary_image",
              "asset_id": "e231e60a-910f-405d-93f0-5c6dd10a14c7",
              "asset_key": "image_2",
              "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_2"
            }
          ],
          "format": "teacherhelper-normalized",
          "sections": [
            {
              "key": "condition",
              "html": "<p>В тре­уголь­ни­ке <var data-math-identifier=\"ABC\">ABC</var>  от­ре­зок <var data-math-identifier=\"DE\">DE</var>  — сред­няя линия. Пло­щадь тре­уголь­ни­ка <var data-math-identifier=\"CDE\">CDE</var> равна 38. Най­ди­те пло­щадь тре­уголь­ни­ка <var data-math-identifier=\"ABC\">ABC</var>.</p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"3f8957dd-6a7f-467f-9ea1-0eeb12e56607\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/3f8957dd-6a7f-467f-9ea1-0eeb12e56607\"/>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": [
                "image_1"
              ],
              "section_id": "condition:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "answer",
              "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">152</span></p>",
              "title": "Ответ",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "answer:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<p>Рас­смот­рим два слу­чая.</p><p>1.  Сред­няя линия <var data-math-identifier=\"DE\">DE</var> па­рал­лель­на сто­ро­не <var data-math-identifier=\"AB\">AB</var>.</p><p>Тре­уголь­ник <var data-math-identifier=\"ABC\">ABC</var> по­до­бен тре­уголь­ни­ку <var data-math-identifier=\"DEC\">DEC</var> с ко­эф­фи­ци­ен­том 2. Пло­ща­ди по­доб­ных фигур от­но­сят­ся как квад­рат ко­эф­фи­ци­ен­та по­до­бия, по­это­му</p><center><p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"e231e60a-910f-405d-93f0-5c6dd10a14c7\" data-asset-key=\"image_2\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_2\" src=\"/assets/e231e60a-910f-405d-93f0-5c6dd10a14c7\"/> <span data-inline-latex=\"S_{ABC}=2^{2}\\cdot 38=152\"></span>.</p></center><p>2.  Сред­няя линия <var data-math-identifier=\"DE\">DE</var> не па­рал­лель­на сто­ро­не <var data-math-identifier=\"AB\">AB</var>. Пусть для опре­делённо­сти точка <var data-math-identifier=\"D\">D</var>  — се­ре­ди­на сто­ро­ны <var data-math-identifier=\"AC\">AC</var>. Тогда от­ре­зок <var data-math-identifier=\"DE\">DE</var>  — ме­ди­а­на тре­уголь­ни­ка <var data-math-identifier=\"ACE\">ACE</var>, и пло­ща­ди тре­уголь­ни­ков <var data-math-identifier=\"CDE\">CDE</var> и <var data-math-identifier=\"AED\">AED</var> равны. От­ре­зок <var data-math-identifier=\"CE\">CE</var>  — ме­ди­а­на тре­уголь­ни­ка <var data-math-identifier=\"ABC\">ABC</var>, и пло­ща­ди тре­уголь­ни­ков <var data-math-identifier=\"CBE\">CBE</var> и <var data-math-identifier=\"ACE\">ACE</var> равны. Сле­до­ва­тель­но,</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"S_{ABC}=S_{AEC}+S_{CBE}=S_{CDE}+S_{ADE}+S_{CBE}=4S_{CDE}=4\\cdot 38=152\"></span>.</p></center><p>-------</p><p>За­да­ча ис­клю­че­на из от­кры­то­го банка.</p>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": [
                "image_2"
              ],
              "section_id": "solution:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            }
          ],
